# agent scratch: per-card verification scripts written while working on a card.
# Not part of the suite (never picked up by `npm test`), frequently a duplicate of an
# assertion already in tests/, and a new one appears on most cards - so ignore the whole
# directory rather than re-deciding it each time.
.hermes-verify/

